comments[8]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-08T16:15:39.497Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: all-status inventory and dependency kind error search inspected; full pm-4020c5 confirms canonical write semantics and ontology are delivered. This residual rendering defect is distinct from canonicalization and has no existing owning item."
  "2026-09-08T16:18:42.192Z","harness:codex","TDD evidence: the compiled CLI regression failed because required contained only Use values that match documented command constraints. The parser now supplies the field label, accepted set and concrete retry in structured context, preserving useful guidance when generic rendering omits parser detail. No rejected value is copied into the new recovery fields."
  "2026-09-08T16:21:40.008Z","harness:codex","Green verification: the compiled CLI regression passes for text and JSON; structured required names dependency kind and all accepted values, and the rejected update preserves the complete get result. The change adds no branches or accepted values and applies through the shared create/update recurrence parser."
  "2026-09-08T16:51:02.478Z","harness:codex","Final implementation evidence: The regression failed before the fix and passes afterward through the compiled CLI for text and JSON, including complete before/after state equality. The full 8615-test run passes at exact 100/100/100/100 coverage."
  "2026-09-08T17:24:50.899Z","harness:codex","Review correction: separate human dependency kind label from the stored kind error-context key at create, update-add and update-remove call sites. Direct SDK error assertion verifies context.field=kind; compiled CLI text/JSON tests retain the complete allowed-value guidance and verify item state is unchanged. Focused enum tests pass."
  "2026-09-08T17:32:21.871Z","harness:codex","Final review-correction evidence for PR #1224: Direct SDK and compiled CLI regressions pass, including complete before/after state equality. Linked tests and all 8619 repository tests pass at exact 100/100/100/100 coverage."
  "2026-09-08T21:35:01.781Z","harness:codex","Sixth-round regression: the existing direct parser test now also invokes _testOnlyUpdateCommand.parseDependencyRemovals and verifies context.field=kind plus the human dependency-kind constraint. Real CLI text/JSON and state-preservation assertions remain intact."
  "2026-09-08T21:57:59.733Z","harness:codex","Sixth-round verification: all 8622 tests in 653 files pass with exact 100/100/100/100 coverage and zero uncovered statements, branches, functions and lines. All four TypeScript projects, the full quality:static gate, serialized docs/skills checks, and every linked test command pass. Both original clone profiles remain unchanged; the supplementary historical-table profile also passes. Final pushed-head CI, full platform matrix, review and preflight remain required before merge."
